{title: Honor Your Father And Mother}
{subtitle: Ephesians 6:1–3}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 150}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Gm7] | [Cm7] [F7] | [Dm7] [G7] |
| [Cm7] [F7] | [Bb] [Gm7] | [Cm7] [F7] | [Bb] [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]Children obey in the Lord today
For [Cm7]this way is right and true
[F7]Heaven's law is clear to show
[Bb]What the heart must [F7]always [Bb]do
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
Listen now to the command
First of [Cm7]all with a promise
That [F7]you might live long on earth
And [Bb]find your [F7]life in [Bb]blessing
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Honor your [Eb]father and moth[F7]er
[Dm7]This is the first command[Gm]ment
With a [Cm7]promise for your days
So [Eb]that it [F7]may go [Bb]well [Gm7][Cm7][F7][Bb][Eb][Bb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Walk in the path that is set
O[Cm7]bey the voice of the Lord
[F7]This is right before your eyes
[Bb]Keep the [F7]covenant [Bb]word
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Honor your [Eb]father and moth[F7]er
[Dm7]This is the first command[Gm]ment
With a [Cm7]promise for your days
So [Eb]that it [F7]may go [Bb]well
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [Cm7] [F7] | [Bb] | [Bb] | [Eb] |
| [F7] | [Dm7] | [Gm7] | [Cm7] |
| [F7] | [Bb] | [Bb] |

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Eb]Live long on the [F]earth
[Dm7]Go well in your [Gm]days
[Cm7]Honor the command
[Eb]Keep the [F7]sacred [Bb]ways
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Honor your [Eb]father and moth[F7]er
[Dm7]This is the first command[Gm]ment
With a [Cm7]promise for your days
So [Eb]that it [F7]may go [Bb][Gm7]well
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Instrumental}
| [Cm7] [F7] | [Bb] [Gm7] | [Cm7] [F7] | [Bb] [Gm7] |
| [Cm7] [F7] | [Bb] [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Bb]Honor your [Eb]father and [Dm7]mother [Gm7]
[Cm7]Live [F7]long in the [Bb]land
{end_of_verse}

